      "sha256": "7ad8d57459782b70809da479380584a57cf259c66d9ff286811c0248b02732d2",
      "text": "         I2.2.5 The boundary between the bottom and lower regions is to be taken at the point where\n         the shell is inclined 7° from horizontal.\n\n",
      "authority": "User-supplied retained source document; interpretations are not independently verified",
      "selection": {
        "start": 3906,
        "end": 4058,
        "section_ids": [
          "I2.2.5"
